    "chunk_text": "\u00d0\u00e6r cu\u00f0e w\u00e6ron & gyta syndon. & sancta Eadburh \u00fea to \u00f0am mynstre feng \u00e6fter sancte Myldry\u00fee. & heo \u00f0a cyricean ar\u00e6rde, \u00f0e hyre lichama nu inne reste\u00f0. \u00d0onne w\u00e6s sancte Seaxburh & sancta \u00e6\u00feeldry\u00f0 & sancta Wihtburh, hy w\u00e6ron Annan dohtra, EastEngla \u00d0onne w\u00e6s sancta \u00e6\u00feeldry\u00f0 forgyfen twam werum, Tondbryhte Su\u00f0gyrwena ealdorm\u00e6n & Ecgfer\u00f0e & heo \u00f0eahhw\u00e6\u00feere hyre m\u00e6g\u00f0had geheold o\u00f0 hyre lifes ende. & heo \u00f0a hyre licreste geceas on Eligbyrig & \u00f0\u00e6r hyre mihta oft cu\u00f0e syndon. \u00d0onne w\u00e6s sancte Eormenhild, Ercenbrihtes dohtor & Seaxburge, forgyfen Wulfhere, Pendan sunu & on hyra dagum Myrcena \u00f0eod onfeng fulluht. & \u00f0\u00e6r hi begeaton sancte W\u00e6rburge \u00f0a halige f\u00e6mnan. & heo reste\u00fe on \u00f0am mynstre, \u00fee is gecweden Heanburh. \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Eormenhild on Eligbyrig mid hyre meder & mid hyre modrian sancte \u00e6\u00feeldry\u00f0a & & sancta Seaxburh & sancta Eormenhild onfengon haligrifte on \u00f0am mynstre, \u00fee is gecweden & \u00fe\u00e6t igland on Sc\u00e6pyge hyr\u00f0 into Middeltune & hit is \u00f0reora mila brad & seofan mila lang. \u00d0a gelicode \u00f0\u00e6re halgan cwene Seaxburge, \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00f0\u00e6rbinnan for myrhde & for m\u00e6r\u00f0e hyre \u00f0\u00e6r \u00d0a \u00fe\u00e6t",
